<title>GERMANY: Linde says sees higher 1997 sales, profit.</title>
<headline>Linde says sees higher 1997 sales, profit.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering group Linde AG said on Tuesday that it expected its 1997 sales to grow at a similar rate to that seen in 1996.</p>
<p>Linde chief executive Hans Meinhardt told a news conference he also expected earnings to also improve in the current year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
